 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>突破速度极限的迷幻风超高速竞速游戏。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家将驾驶快到离谱的飞船，在广袤的宇宙圆柱体表面极限狂飙。速度没有上限，全看你的专注力能撑多远。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>无刹车，无限速</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这款游戏根本没打算让你减速，游戏的核心玩法就是不断加速。这里没有刹车，毕竟刹车太无聊了。<br><br>但有个加速键，无冷却无限制，想怎么按就怎么按。<br><br>在这里，越飙越快绝不是什么惩罚——这恰恰是游戏的终极奥义。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>极速体验，触碰即死</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >绝大多数单次尝试连30秒都撑不过去，撞上障碍物直接粉身碎骨。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>三种速度级别</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过三种速度级别来证明自己的实力：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>心流</strong>：容错率高，有充足的时间供你反应并熟悉赛道。哪怕全程死按着加速键也能顺利通关；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>极速</strong>：情况开始变得硬核起来了，但你大概率还是能一脚油门踩到底；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>超频</strong>：速通玩家的专属修罗场，快到让人心跳骤停。如果你无法做到全神贯注或彻底沉浸其中，那这一档绝对会劝退你。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>操作上限极高</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >就算你能全程按住加速不松手，那也只是基本功，你其实还能再快点：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>极限擦边</strong>：贴着障碍物惊险掠过即可获得额外加速，风险越大回报越高；<br><strong>平滑度</strong>：大幅转向会损耗速度，规划出完美的行车线才能保住好不容易提上来的极速状态；<br><strong>完美路线</strong>：利用圆柱体弧度找到最短路径，把通关时间再缩短几毫秒。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>全球排行榜与幽灵回放</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >想象一下在同一条赛道死磕30次后终于拿到了金杯，结果点开排行榜一看发现世界纪录居然比你快了足足5秒，于是你不信邪地下载了对方的幽灵回放仔细钻研。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你深知自己肯定能跑得更快。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >决定再跑一局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>多人模式</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这里谁都是两眼一抹黑，纯随机赛道意味着200小时老鸟也未必能碾压只玩了2小时的萌新，谁能活到最后谁就是大赢家，最多支持8人同台狂飙。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏特色</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>毫无速度上限，</strong>绝大多数竞速游戏都会限制最高时速，但本作偏不。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>360度环绕赛道，</strong>致命缝隙会从四面八方逼近，整个圆柱体表面都是你的跑道。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>三种速度级别，</strong>体验从勉强看清路况到人车合一的极限飞驰。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>多人模式，</strong>最多支持8人在随机赛道上同台竞速。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>奖杯评级与全球排行榜，</strong>全新世界纪录正等你去打破。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>短平快且上限极高，</strong>上手毫无门槛，却能让你在不断挑战中磨砺车技。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>迷幻风体素美学，</strong>视听体验和飙车手感一样风驰电掣。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>核心机制要求高度专注，</strong>令人窒息的极速让你没得选，要么进入心流要么撞得粉碎。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>迷幻电音配乐，</strong>动感十足的轰炸节拍与极速狂飙完美契合</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>突破速度极限的迷幻风超高速竞速游戏。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家将驾驶快到离谱的飞船，在广袤的宇宙圆柱体表面极限狂飙。速度没有上限，全看你的专注力能撑多远。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>无刹车，无限速</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这款游戏根本没打算让你减速，游戏的核心玩法就是不断加速。这里没有刹车，毕竟刹车太无聊了。<br><br>但有个加速键，无冷却无限制，想怎么按就怎么按。<br><br>在这里，越飙越快绝不是什么惩罚——这恰恰是游戏的终极奥义。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>极速体验，触碰即死</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >绝大多数单次尝试连30秒都撑不过去，撞上障碍物直接粉身碎骨。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>三种速度级别</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过三种速度级别来证明自己的实力：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>心流</strong>：容错率高，有充足的时间供你反应并熟悉赛道。哪怕全程死按着加速键也能顺利通关；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>极速</strong>：情况开始变得硬核起来了，但你大概率还是能一脚油门踩到底；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>超频</strong>：速通玩家的专属修罗场，快到让人心跳骤停。如果你无法做到全神贯注或彻底沉浸其中，那这一档绝对会劝退你。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>操作上限极高</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >就算你能全程按住加速不松手，那也只是基本功，你其实还能再快点：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>极限擦边</strong>：贴着障碍物惊险掠过即可获得额外加速，风险越大回报越高；<br><strong>平滑度</strong>：大幅转向会损耗速度，规划出完美的行车线才能保住好不容易提上来的极速状态；<br><strong>完美路线</strong>：利用圆柱体弧度找到最短路径，把通关时间再缩短几毫秒。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>全球排行榜与幽灵回放</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >想象一下在同一条赛道死磕30次后终于拿到了金杯，结果点开排行榜一看发现世界纪录居然比你快了足足5秒，于是你不信邪地下载了对方的幽灵回放仔细钻研。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你深知自己肯定能跑得更快。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >决定再跑一局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>多人模式</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这里谁都是两眼一抹黑，纯随机赛道意味着200小时老鸟也未必能碾压只玩了2小时的萌新，谁能活到最后谁就是大赢家，最多支持8人同台狂飙。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏特色</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>毫无速度上限，</strong>绝大多数竞速游戏都会限制最高时速，但本作偏不。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>360度环绕赛道，</strong>致命缝隙会从四面八方逼近，整个圆柱体表面都是你的跑道。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>三种速度级别，</strong>体验从勉强看清路况到人车合一的极限飞驰。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>多人模式，</strong>最多支持8人在随机赛道上同台竞速。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>奖杯评级与全球排行榜，</strong>全新世界纪录正等你去打破。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>短平快且上限极高，</strong>上手毫无门槛，却能让你在不断挑战中磨砺车技。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>迷幻风体素美学，</strong>视听体验和飙车手感一样风驰电掣。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>核心机制要求高度专注，</strong>令人窒息的极速让你没得选，要么进入心流要么撞得粉碎。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>迷幻电音配乐，</strong>动感十足的轰炸节拍与极速狂飙完美契合</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
 "short_description": "在这款无速度上限且没有刹车的迷幻风超高速竞速游戏中，在旋转的宇宙圆柱体表面极限擦边并疯狂加速，单局不到30秒且触碰即死，随时准备迎接肾上腺素的狂飙。挑战世界纪录，与幽灵回放竞速，或是叫上7位好友来一场别开生面的竞速对决！",
